### PDF Upload API Test File
### Use this file to test the PDF upload endpoint

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@workspaceId = YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID_HERE
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Upload Single PDF
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/pdfs/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/sample.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 2. Upload Multiple PDFs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/pdfs/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/document1.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/document2.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Test with Invalid File Type (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/pdfs/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="document.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./path/to/your/document.txt
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Test Upload Progress Endpoint (Placeholder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/pdfs/upload/progress/{{$guid}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Test Without Authentication (Should Return 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/pdfs/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/sample.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

